From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Damien Mascord <tusker@tusker.org>
Subject: [PATCH] powerpc: dts: firebox-t30: add bootargs-override

U-Boot on the WatchGuard Firebox T30 passes root=/dev/mmcblk0p3 on the
kernel command line, which points to the ext2 boot partition rather than
the squashfs rootfs on mmcblk0p2. Add bootargs-override in the chosen
node so the kernel mounts the correct root partition.

Signed-off-by: Damien Mascord <tusker@tusker.org>
Signed-off-by: Lefteris Koutrakis <lefteris.koutrakis@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/powerpc/boot/dts/fsl/firebox-t30.dts
+++ b/arch/powerpc/boot/dts/fsl/firebox-t30.dts
@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@
 	model = "Watchguard Firebox T30";
 	compatible = "watchguard,firebox-t30", "fsl,P1020RDB";
 
+	chosen {
+		bootargs-override = "root=/dev/mmcblk0p2 rootfstype=squashfs,ext4 rootwait console=ttyS0,115200";
+	};
+
 	memory {
 		device_type = "memory";
 	};
